Surface Laptop 7 touchpad: HID-over-SPI driver, QSPI mode for the GENI SPI
controller and GPI DMA, and the touchpad node on spi19.

Squashed from ProgrammerIn-wonderland/ELLX-Kernel ecbf0fa3e418..b6ab6012cb0b
(the in-review spi-hid series plus scruggo's QSPI/romulus changes). Rebased
onto v7.2: there is no `struct geni_spi_desc` yet, so QSPI mode is a flag set
from the "qcom,geni-spi-qspi" compatible.

